  "cited_article_id": "configure-online-appointment-booking",
  "reply": "To limit online booking to specific visit types and providers, enable online booking (Settings > Patient Portal > Booking Rules > Allow Online Appointment Booking), then:\n1. In Settings > Schedule > Provider Availability, select only the staff members who should accept online requests.\n2. In Scheduling > Visit Types, open each visit type you want available and check **Available Online**; leave the box unchecked for all other visit types.\nOnly the providers you selected and the visit types marked “Available Online” will appear to patients in the portal."
}
